        Instantánea publicada por The Clinic sobre el instructivo vigente desde {fmtFecha(d.topes_dipres.vigencia_desde)}. No es una serie de remuneraciones observadas cargo por cargo. <SRef id={topesFuenteId} />
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-base-300">
              <th class="sticky left-0 z-10 bg-base-100 text-left py-2 px-3 font-medium text-base-content/80">Rango</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 px-3 font-medium text-base-content/80">Kast (tope)</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 px-3 font-medium text-base-content/80">Boric (tope)</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 px-3 font-medium text-base-content/80">Diferencia</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {topes.map((t) => (
              <tr class="border-b border-base-300">
                <td class="sticky left-0 bg-base-100 py-2 px-3 text-base-content">{t.rango}</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right tabular-nums font-medium">{formatCLP(t.tope_kast)}</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right tabular-nums text-base-content/60">{t.tope_boric ? formatCLP(t.tope_boric) : '—'}</td>
                <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right tabular-nums text-error font-medium">{t.tope_boric ? `+${pctDiff(t.tope_kast, t.tope_boric)}%` : '—'}</td>
